OL,3,GNEWSAMystery of Bayeux Tapestry theft
OL,4,Are-told by actors
OL,5,
OL,6,FDid a Victorian woman from Devon steal
OL,7,Fa piece of the Bayeux Tapestry?
OL,9,FHistory re-enactors in Tavistock have
OL,10,Fbeen probing the 19th Century case of
OL,11,FEliza Bray, who was once accused of
OL,12,Fsnipping off a piece of the famous
OL,13,Fembroidery.
OL,15,FBray was more recently exonerated by
OL,16,FMichael Lewis, a curator at the British
OL,17,FMuseum, who thinks it was probably her
OL,18,Ffirst husband Charles Stothard who took
OL,19,Fthe cutting as a souvenir 200 years
OL,20,Fago.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
