OL,3,GNEWSAMystery of Bayeux Tapestry theft
OL,4,Are-told by actors
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said Stothard was an artist sent to
OL,7,FBayeux to make a watercolour painting
OL,8,Fof the 11th century masterpiece. But
OL,9,Fwhen he took a piece of it home his
OL,10,Fwife got the blame.
